><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1300" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="31" name="Shape 29"></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="6583680" y="3520440"/><a:ext cx="4937760" cy="2743200"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst></a:avLst></a:prstGeom><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="1B2752"/></a:solidFill><a:ln w="6350"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="C8F751"/></a:solidFill><a:prstDash val="solid"/></a:ln></p:spPr></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="32" name="Text 30"></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="6720840" y="3611880"/><a:ext cx="4663440" cy="256032"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst></a:avLst></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln></a:ln></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr indent="0" marL="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="900" b="1" spc="300" kern="0" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="C8F751"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>WHAT THIS MEANS</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="900" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="33" name="Text 31"></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="6720840" y="3886200"/><a:ext cx="4663440" cy="2286000"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst></a:avLst></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln></a:ln></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr indent="0" marL="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" i="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="F4E9D8"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>α (alpha) is a &apos;trust meter&apos; from 0 to 1. If we have lots of data for an area, α gets close to 1 — we trust the score and show it as-is. If we only have one or two crimes recorded, α stays close to 0 — we pull the score back down toward the &apos;safe&apos; baseline. Effect: a small, possibly random spike in a quiet area never paints the map red.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="34" name="Text 32"></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="457200" y="6492240"/><a:ext cx="7315200" cy="274320"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst></a:avLst></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln></a:ln></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr indent="0" marL="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="900" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="9AA8C7"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>SafeVision  ·  FYP 2025–26  ·  UET Lahore</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="900" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="35" name="Text 33"></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="10789920" y="6492240"/><a:ext cx="914400" cy="274320"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst></a:avLst></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln></a:ln></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr algn="r" indent="0" marL="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="900" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="C8F751"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Calibri" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Calibr